  {
    "name": "rehearse_command",
    "annotations": {
      "readOnlyHint": true,
      "openWorldHint": false
    },
    "inputSchema": {
      "$schema": "https://json-schema.org/draft/2020-12/schema",
      "required": [
        "command",
        "payload"
      ],
      "properties": {
        "command": {
          "description": "Dotted command name — one of the rehearsable commands\n(`gpke.lieferbeginn.anmelden`, `gpke.lieferende.anmelden`,\n`gpke.kuendigung.anmelden`, `geli.lieferbeginn.anmelden`,\n`geli.lieferende.anmelden`, `geli.kuendigung.anmelden`).",
          "type": "string",
          "examples": [
            "\"geli.lieferbeginn.anmelden\""
          ]
        },
        "marktrolle": {
          "description": "Marktrolle to rehearse as — required only for multi-role commands.",
          "type": [
            "string",
            "null"
          ]
        },
        "payload": {
          "description": "The command's payload, exactly as `submit_command` takes it."
        }
      },
      "type": "object"
    },
    "outputSchema": {
      "$schema": "https://json-schema.org/draft/2020-12/schema",
      "$defs": {
        "Urteil": {
          "description": "What the pre-send check says about a rehearsed command.",
          "oneOf": [
            {
              "description": "The door built the message and the pre-send check passes it.",
              "type": "string",
              "const": "besteht"
            },
            {
              "description": "The door or the pre-send check refuses; `grund` says which and why.",
              "type": "string",
              "const": "abgelehnt"
            }
          ]
        },
        "Stufe": {
          "description": "Where a refusal came from.",
          "oneOf": [
            {
              "description": "The door refused the command before a message existed — a missing\nfield, a Marktlokation not in the cache, a Stammdatum marktd lacks.",
              "type": "string",
              "const": "tuer"
            },
            {
              "description": "The door built the message and its profile refuses it.",
              "type": "string",
              "const": "pruefung"
            }
          ]
        },
        "ProbeNachricht": {
          "description": "One message the door built.",
          "type": "object",
          "properties": {
            "nachrichtentyp": {
              "description": "`UTILMD`, ….",
              "type": "string"
            },
            "pruefidentifikator": {
              "description": "The Prüfidentifikator the message carries.",
              "type": [
                "integer",
                "null"
              ],
              "format": "uint32",
              "minimum": 0
            },
            "empfaenger": {
              "description": "The MP-ID it is addressed to.",
              "type": "string"
            },
            "formatversion": {
              "description": "The format version whose profile named the segments (`FV2025-10-01`).",
              "type": [
                "string",
                "null"
              ]
            },
            "ahb_version": {
              "description": "The AHB version of that profile.",
              "type": [
                "string",
                "null"
              ]
            },
            "wire": {
              "description": "The interchange as rendered, `UNA` … `UNZ`.",
              "type": "string"
            },
            "segmente": {
              "description": "The message, `UNH` … `UNT`, segment by segment.",
              "type": "array",
              "items": {
                "$ref": "#/$defs/ProbeSegment"
              }
            },
            "befunde": {
              "description": "Findings the check placed on no single segment.",
              "type": "array",
              "items": {
                "$ref": "#/$defs/ProbeBefund"
              }
            }
          },
          "required": [
            "nachrichtentyp",
            "pruefidentifikator",
            "empfaenger",
            "formatversion",
            "ahb_version",
            "wire",
            "segmente",
            "befunde"
          ]
        },
        "ProbeSegment": {
          "description": "One segment of the rendered message.",
          "type": "object",
          "properties": {
            "position": {
              "description": "One-based position in the message, `UNH` = 1.",
              "type": "integer",
              "format": "uint32",
              "minimum": 0
            },
            "tag": {
              "description": "The segment tag.",
              "type": "string"
            },
            "nr": {
              "description": "The MIG's running number of the place the segment sits at.",
              "type": [
                "string",
                "null"
              ]
            },
            "gruppe": {
              "description": "The segment groups enclosing the place, outermost first (`SG4/SG8`).",
              "type": [
                "string",
                "null"
              ]
            },
            "name": {
              "description": "The MIG's name for the place; absent when the segment fits no place.",
              "type": [
                "string",
                "null"
              ]
            },
            "text": {
              "description": "The segment as it goes on the wire, terminator included.",
              "type": "string"
            },
            "elemente": {
              "description": "Each data element as written, components joined by `:`.",
              "type": "array",
              "items": {
                "type": "string"
              }
            },
            "befunde": {
              "description": "The findings that sit on this segment.",
              "type": "array",
              "items": {
                "$ref": "#/$defs/ProbeBefund"
              }
            }
          },
          "required": [
            "position",
            "tag",
            "nr",
            "gruppe",
            "name",
            "text",
            "elemente",
            "befunde"
          ]
        },
        "ProbeBefund": {
          "description": "One finding of the pre-send check.",
          "type": "object",
          "properties": {
            "text": {
              "description": "The check's own wording.",
              "type": "string"
            },
            "regel": {
              "description": "The profile rule it rests on (`AHB-…`, `MIG-…`), where it names one.",
              "type": [
                "string",
                "null"
              ]
            },
            "element": {
              "description": "Zero-based index into the segment's `elemente`, where the finding\nnames a data element.",
              "type": [
                "integer",
                "null"
              ],
              "format": "uint16",
              "minimum": 0,
              "maximum": 65535
            },
            "komponente": {
              "description": "Zero-based component within that data element.",
              "type": [
                "integer",
                "null"
              ],
              "format": "uint16",
              "minimum": 0,
              "maximum": 65535
            }
          },
          "required": [
            "text",
            "regel",
            "element",
            "komponente"
          ]
        }
      },
      "required": [
        "command",
        "marktrolle",
        "urteil",
        "stufe",
        "grund",
        "nachrichten"
      ],
      "type": "object",
      "properties": {
        "command": {
          "description": "The command rehearsed.",
          "type": "string"
        },
        "marktrolle": {
          "description": "The Marktrolle it was rehearsed as.",
          "type": "string"
        },
        "urteil": {
          "description": "The pre-send check's verdict.",
          "$ref": "#/$defs/Urteil"
        },
        "stufe": {
          "description": "Where the refusal came from; absent when the message passes.",
          "anyOf": [
            {
              "$ref": "#/$defs/Stufe"
            },
            {
              "type": "null"
            }
          ]
        },
        "grund": {
          "description": "The refusal in the door's own words — the sentence the real command\nwould be answered with.",
          "type": [
            "string",
            "null"
          ]
        },
        "nachrichten": {
          "description": "The messages the door built; empty when it refused before building one.",
          "type": "array",
          "items": {
            "$ref": "#/$defs/ProbeNachricht"
          }
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "name": "submit_command",
    "annotations": {
      "destructiveHint": false,
      "idempotentHint": false,
      "openWorldHint": true
    },
    "inputSchema": {
      "$schema": "https://json-schema.org/draft/2020-12/schema",
      "required": [
        "command",
        "payload"
      ],
      "properties": {
        "command": {
          "description": "Dotted command name in the format `<domain>.<prozess>.<aktion>`.\n\nUse `list_commands` first to discover all available commands for this\ninstance. Examples: `gpke.lieferbeginn.anmelden`,\n`wim.geraetewechsel.beauftragen`, `geli.lieferbeginn.anmelden`.\n\n**Single-role commands** (e.g. `gpke.lieferbeginn.anmelden` → always\n`LF`) do not need `marktrolle`. **Multi-role commands** (e.g.\n`wim.geraetewechsel.beauftragen` → `NB` or `MSB`) require it.",
          "type": "string",
          "examples": [
            "\"gpke.lieferbeginn.anmelden\""
          ]
        },
        "marktrolle": {
          "description": "Marktrolle override — required only for multi-role commands.\n\nPermitted values: `LF`, `LFG`, `NB`, `GNB`, `MSB`, `BKV`, `ÜNB`.\nOmit for single-role commands.",
          "type": [
            "string",
            "null"
          ],
          "examples": [
            "\"NB\""
          ]
        },
        "payload": {
          "description": "Command-specific payload fields.\n\n| Command | Required fields |\n|---|---|\n| `gpke.lieferbeginn.anmelden` | `malo_id` (11-digit), `lieferbeginn_datum` (YYYY-MM-DD), `transaktionsgrund` (`E01` Ein-/Auszug, `E03` Wechsel), `bilanzkreis`, `haushaltskunde`, `enfg_grundlage` (`ZF9`/`ZG0`/`ZG1`, with `enfg_grund` beside `ZF9`), `kunde`, optional `transaktionsgrund_ergaenzung` (`ZW4` default, `ZAP`) — `mako_markt::commands::GpkeLieferbeginnAnmelden`, no other key |\n| `gpke.lieferende.anmelden` | `malo_id`, `lieferende_datum`, `transaktionsgrund`, optional `transaktionsgrund_ergaenzung` (default: the MaLo's energy direction) |\n| `gpke.kuendigung.anmelden` | `malo_id`, `kuendigung_datum`, `lfa_mp_id` (the Altlieferant) |\n| `geli.lieferbeginn.anmelden` | `malo_id` (gas), `process_date` (YYYYMMDD), `transaktionsgrund`, `bilanzkreis`, `abrechnungsintervall_monate`, `haushaltskunde`, `netznutzungsvertrag`, `netznutzung_zahler`, `gemeinderabatt_prozent`, `kunde`, `ablesekarte` — `mako_markt::commands::GeliLieferbeginnAnmelden`, no other key |\n| `geli.lieferende.anmelden` | `malo_id` (gas), `process_date` (YYYYMMDD), `transaktionsgrund` — `mako_markt::commands::GeliLieferendeAnmelden`, no other key |\n| `geli.kuendigung.anmelden` | `malo_id` (gas), `process_date` (YYYYMMDD), `lfa_mp_id` (the Altlieferant) — `mako_markt::commands::GeliKuendigungAnmelden`, no other key |\n| `geli.stammdaten-aenderung.beantworten` | `malo_id` (gas), `antwort_code` (a code of the Antwort column's Codeliste — `E15` on a 44115) — `mako_markt::commands::GeliStammdatenAenderungBeantworten`, no other key |\n| `geli.stammdaten-aenderung.senden` | `malo_id` (gas), `pid` (44112, 44123, 44175, 44109 or 44120), `empfaenger_mp_id`, `aenderungsdatum` / `vertragsbeginn` (YYYYMMDD), `gruppen` (the changed groups on a 44112 / 44109, none otherwise); on a 44109 the LF's `abrechnungsintervall_monate`, `haushaltskunde`, `kunde`, on a 44120 its `bilanzkreis` — `mako_markt::commands::GeliStammdatenAenderungSenden`, no other key |\n| `wim.geraetewechsel.beauftragen` | `melo_id`, `process_date` (YYYYMMDD), `receiver_mp_id` |\n| `mabis.abrechnung.einleiten` | `bilanzierungsgebiet`, `abrechnungszeitraum_von`, `abrechnungszeitraum_bis` |",
          "examples": [
            "{\"malo_id\": \"51238696012\", \"lieferbeginn_datum\": \"2026-10-01\", \"transaktionsgrund\": \"E03\", \"bilanzkreis\": \"11XBK-LF-------9\", \"haushaltskunde\": true, \"enfg_grundlage\": \"ZG1\", \"kunde\": {\"nachname\": \"Mustermann\", \"anschrift\": {\"strasse\": \"Hauptstraße\", \"hausnummer\": \"1\", \"postleitzahl\": \"50667\", \"ort\": \"Köln\", \"landescode\": \"DE\"}}}"
          ]
        },
        "idempotency_key": {
          "description": "Optional stable key identifying this business request.\n\nSupply the same value on a retry and the recorded response is replayed\ninstead of the command running twice; the record lives for 24 hours.\nReusing one key for a different command or payload is refused. When\nomitted a random UUID is echoed back and no replay record is kept.",
          "type": [
            "string",
            "null"
          ]
        }
      },
      "type": "object"
    },
    "outputSchema": null
  }
]
